# FlowTrace .gitignore

## macOS
.DS_Store
.AppleDouble
.LSOverride

## IntelliJ / Android Studio
.idea/
*.iml
*.ipr
*.iws
out/

## Gradle
.gradle/
**/build/
**/.cxx/
**/.externalNativeBuild/

## Android
*.apk
*.aab
*.keystore
*.jks
local.properties

## Native libs (generated locally, do not commit)
android/app/src/main/jniLibs/**/libsunnynet.so
android/app/src/main/jniLibs/**/*.so
android/app/src/main/jniLibs/**/libsunnynet.h

## Third-party build sources/artifacts (generated locally)
third_party/
scripts/.cache/

## Kotlin
*.kotlin_module

## Logs / temp / tooling
*.log
tmp/
temp/
.cache/

## Sensitive / capture artifacts (MUST NOT COMMIT)
**/*.p12
**/*_ca.pem
**/*_key.pem
**/certs/
**/captures/
**/exports/
**/sessions/
**/bodies/

## Cursor
.cursor/

## Misc
android/_patch_test.txt
